# Docs

- Behaviour for apps, tokens, components, EAS, or scripts is documented under `docs/`.
- A new component gets a row in `docs/base-components.md`.
- A new script gets a section in the matching guide and a Cursor command if developers run it.
- Do not add a second README inside a package when `docs/` already covers it.
- Keep the index in `docs/README.md` in sync when a guide is added.
